      "id": "cost-revolution-narrative",
      "insight": "Show the dramatic decline in LCOE for solar, wind, and battery storage from 2010 to 2024 alongside rising installed capacity, visually contrasting these trajectories against the volatile but persistent scale of fossil fuel subsidy levels"
